   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/bullet-beach.jpg\" alt=\"vanquish 440 uk metal detecting beaches\" title=\"Minelab Vanquish 440 beach metal detecting\" width=\"355\" height=\"200\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "h2",
   "html": "New at beach metal detecting"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "with the Minelab Vanquish 440, pete is doing lots of learning about settings and what they mean when you change a setting on the Vanquish 440."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Buster has used the Minelab Vanquish 340 and Vanquish 540 detecting on the beach and is familiar with how changing a setting affects what it does to the Detector, but now he has upgraded to the Minelab Equinox 600 so is having a whole new time learning with his new metal detector.."
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/Detexpert-Header1.png\" alt=\"minelab vanquish uk\" title=\"paul cee metal detecting\" width=\"356\" height=\"148\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "I was using the Minelab CTX 3030 and Equinox 800 and found some HUGE Bullets from WW2"
  }
